# Control, not ownership: Bot2 casts Geist on turn 2 (Island + Mox Pearl) and Bot1 wins the flip of Invert Polarity
# ({U}{U}{R}: Island, Mox Sapphire, Mox Ruby), so Bot1 controls Bot2's Geist. On turn 3 Bot1's Lightning Greaves ({2}) costs {1}
# (Mox Jet alone); on turn 4 Bot2, the owner, pays the full {2}. The first coin face is a win.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Invert Polarity
Lightning Greaves
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Geist of Saint Thalia
Lightning Greaves
